SF0082 Omnibus water bill-planning.
Sponsored By: Select Water Committee
AN ACT relating to water development projects; authorizing specified level I
and level II studies; providing appropriations; requiring reports; providing
for the reversion of unexpended funds; authorizing unobligated funds to be used
to complete other designated projects as specified; and providing for an
effective date.
